# Local agent configuration; never published.
.claude/

# Upstream ships a self-signed TLS keypair for the CSF web UI. The private key
# is identical in every CSF release, so it is a published, shared credential
# rather than a secret. This fork runs CSF headless and does not republish
# private keys; the release artifact keeps the upstream files verbatim.
csf/ui/server.key
csf/ui/ssl-expired/server.key
